# 统一文本文件处理：仓库内文本一律 LF，二进制文件显式声明，避免跨平台 diff 噪声。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Rust
*.rs text
*.toml text

# 文档
*.md text
*.mdx text
docs/** linguist-documentation

# 构建产物不参与 diff / 语言统计
/target/** linguist-vendored
Cargo.lock -diff linguist-generated

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.onnx binary
*.onnxruntime binary
.DS_Store binary

# GitHub Actions / 模板
.github/workflows/*.yml text
